:: RobinTemple Bed Afternoon
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.stage is 'promised' and $robinromance is 1
  and $RobinTemple.penance_day lt 0 and !$robinmissing
  and getRobinLocation() is 'temple' and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80
  and $robin.timer.hurt is 0 and !Time.schoolDay and !Time.isWeekEnd()
  and Time.hour gte 13 and Time.hour lt 16>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin sets down the work list and joins you beside <<his>> bunk. The other initiates are occupied elsewhere. <<He>> draws the folding screen across the empty row, then sits with you on the edge of the mattress.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾放下工作表，来到自己的床铺旁。其他见习者都在别处忙碌。<<He>>拉上这一排床铺的屏风，挨着你坐在床垫边缘。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if $RobinTemple.evaluation_style is 'protective'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "You told Jordan you would keep every hurt from me," <<he>> says. "You do not have to promise that again. Just tell me when something is wrong."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “你曾对约旦说，会替我挡下所有伤害，”<<he>>说，“别再答应这种事了。有难处就告诉我。”
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "I meant what I said at the altar," <<he>> says. "Even when I have to leave for work or the orphanage."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “我在祭坛前说的话是真心的，”<<he>>说，“就算我还要照顾生意、回孤儿院，也是一样。”
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '问罗宾是否习惯了新的誓言' 'RobinTemple Bed Afternoon Talk'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<loveicon 'kiss'>><<lanLink '问罗宾要不要更亲近些' 'RobinTemple Bed Afternoon Invite'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>Robin is not at the bunk now.
    <<option 'CN'>>罗宾现在不在床铺旁。
  <</language>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<icon 'temple/RobinTemplebed.png'>><<lanLink '回到床边' 'RobinTemple Bunk'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Bed Afternoon Talk
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.stage is 'promised' and !$robinmissing
  and getRobinLocation() is 'temple' and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin turns the silver ring once around <<his>> finger. "I am still learning what it means," <<he>> says. "Jordan witnessed it. That does not mean I need permission to tell you how I feel."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾转了转手上的银戒。“我还在琢磨它意味着什么，”<<he>>说，“约旦见证了誓言，但我不必得到谁的允许，才能对你说心里话。”
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You stay together until the next shift begins. Robin folds the screen back and returns to the work list.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你们一直坐到下一班开始。罗宾收起屏风，回到工作表旁。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>Robin has already left.
    <<option 'CN'>>罗宾已经离开了。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon 'temple/RobinTemplebed.png'>><<lanLink '回到床边' 'RobinTemple Bunk'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Bed Afternoon Invite
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.stage is 'promised' and $robinromance is 1
  and $RobinTemple.penance_day lt 0 and !$robinmissing
  and getRobinLocation() is 'temple' and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80
  and $robin.timer.hurt is 0>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin looks toward the empty row, then back at you. "Only if we both want to," <<he>> says. <<He>> waits for your answer.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾看了看空着的床铺，又转向你。“得我们都愿意才行，”<<he>>说，等着你的回答。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <!-- TODO（作者）：在此补写英中双语的亲密邀请文本，保留罗宾自愿作答的条件，并确保其他见习者不在床铺附近。 -->
  <<loveicon 'kiss'>><<lanLink '与罗宾做爱' 'RobinTemple Bed Sex'>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</lanLink>><<promiscuous1>><<kissvirginitywarning>><<NPCvirginitywarning 'Robin' 'kiss'>><br>
  <<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink '只抱着罗宾待一会儿' 'RobinTemple Bed Afternoon Hold'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>Robin cannot stay with you now.
    <<option 'CN'>>罗宾现在不能留下陪你。
  <</language>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<icon 'temple/RobinTemplebed.png'>><<lanLink '回到床边' 'RobinTemple Bunk'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Bed Afternoon Hold
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.stage is 'promised' and $robinromance is 1
  and !$robinmissing and getRobinLocation() is 'temple'
  and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin rests against you until the bell for the next shift sounds. <<He>> folds the screen back before anyone returns.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾靠着你，直到下一班的钟声响起。趁其他人还没回来，<<he>>收起屏风。
  <</language>>
  <<npcincr Robin love 1>><br><br><<glove>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>Robin has already left.
    <<option 'CN'>>罗宾已经离开了。
  <</language>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<icon 'temple/RobinTemplebed.png'>><<lanLink '回到床边' 'RobinTemple Bunk'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Bed Sex
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>>
<!-- 标记保存在 V 中，战斗期间读档也能保留神殿床铺这个返回位置。 -->
<<if $sexstart is 1 and $RobinTemple.stage is 'promised'
  and $robinromance is 1 and $RobinTemple.penance_day lt 0
  and !$robinmissing and getRobinLocation() is 'temple'
  and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80
  and $robin.timer.hurt is 0>>
  <<set $sexstart to 0>><<set $RobinTemple.intimacy_active to true>>
  <<clearnpc>><<npc Robin>><<person1>><<run statusCheck('Robin')>>
  <<consensual>><<set $consensual to 1>><<neutral 1>>
  <<if $exposed lt 2>><<strip>><</if>>
  <<maninit>><<set $enemytrust += 500>><<set $enemyarousalmax to 600>>
  <<npcexpose>><<npckiss>>
  <!-- TODO（作者）：在此补写英中双语的战斗开场文本。此分支只执行一次，开场文本应放在条件分支内。 -->
<</if>>
<<if $RobinTemple.intimacy_active>>
  <<set $enemyanger to 0>>
  <<effects>><<effectsman>><<man>><<stateman>>
  <br><br><<actionsman>>
  <<if _combatend or $consensual isnot 1>>
    <span id='next'><<lanLink '继续' 'RobinTemple Bed Sex Finish'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
  <<else>>
    <span id='next'><<lanLink '继续' 'RobinTemple Bed Sex'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<set $sexstart to 0>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>Robin is not at the bunk now.
    <<option 'CN'>>罗宾现在不在床铺旁。
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<icon 'temple/RobinTemplebed.png'>><<lanLink '回到床边' 'RobinTemple Bunk'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>

:: RobinTemple Bed Sex Finish
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.intimacy_active>>
  <<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
    <<ejaculation>><<npcincr Robin lust -20>>
  <</if>>
  <<if $consensual isnot 1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>Robin draws back. You give <<him>> room, and neither of you tries to continue.
      <<option 'CN'>>罗宾退开了。你给<<him>>让出地方，谁也没有继续。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<takeKissVirginity 'Robin' 'loveInterest'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin folds the screen back. "The others will be back soon," <<he>> says, straightening the blanket before returning to the work list.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾收起屏风。“他们快回来了。”<<he>>说，理好毯子后回到工作表旁。
    <</language>>
    <!-- TODO（作者）：在此按 $enemyarousal、$enemyhealth 和 $finish 补写英中双语收尾差分，保留下方的清理逻辑。 -->
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<clotheson>><<endcombat>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.intimacy_active to false>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>The bunk is quiet again.
    <<option 'CN'>>床铺旁又安静下来。
  <</language>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<icon 'temple/RobinTemplebed.png'>><<lanLink '回到床边' 'RobinTemple Bunk'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
